  Fields: ['1a04e75e-3113-4086-904e-a9832154f9cf', "Before we begin…This deck is generated by over 3,000 lines of codeand I felt it deserved seven cards for orientation.(You can delete or suspend these cards so they don't appear again.){{c1::The first thing you should know:this deck has a manual.I highly recommend you check it out.::…OK…}}", '', '']
